### PoRepoLineTracker API Test Suite
### Base URL: https://localhost:5001 (or http://localhost:5000)
### Requires: Azurite running (docker compose up -d)

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

# ============================================================
# Health & Diagnostics
# ============================================================

### Health Check (unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Diagnostics (requires auth — obtain cookie first via /test-login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag
Accept: application/json

# ============================================================
# Dev Authentication (Development Only)
# ============================================================

### Dev Login by UserId (bypasses GitHub OAuth — Development Only)
# Returns an auth cookie for the supplied userId, creating the user if missing.
# Use any deterministic GUID; the seeded default is shown below.
GET {{baseUrl}}/dev-login/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Test Login (returns auth cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/test-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "",
  "userAgent": "HttpClient"
}

# ============================================================
# Authentication (requires cookie from /test-login first)
# ============================================================

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### GitHub OAuth Login (browser-only, redirects)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login

### Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

# ============================================================
# Repositories
# ============================================================

### List My Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Accept: application/json

### Add a Repository
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "dotnet",
  "name": "roslyn"
}

### Get Repository by ID (replace {id} with actual GUID)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}
# Accept: application/json

### Get Repository Line Count History
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}/linecounts
# Accept: application/json

### Get Repository Top Files
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}/topfiles?limit=10
# Accept: application/json

### Get Repository Extensions
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}/extensions
# Accept: application/json

### Trigger Repository Refresh
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}/refresh

### Delete Repository
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{id}

# ============================================================
# GitHub API
# ============================================================

### List GitHub Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/github/repositories
Accept: application/json

### Get GitHub Repository Stats
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/github/repositories/{owner}/{repo}/statistics
# Accept: application/json

# ============================================================
# Settings
# ============================================================

### Get User Preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Accept: application/json

### Update User Preferences
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "dark",
  "defaultBranch": "main",
  "maxRepositories": 50
}

# ============================================================
# Failed Operations
# ============================================================

### List Failed Operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/failed-operations
Accept: application/json

### Retry Failed Operation
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/failed-operations/{id}/retry